<title>UK: Centrobanca to issue 500 bln lire eight-yr FRN - JPM.</title>
<headline>Centrobanca to issue 500 bln lire eight-yr FRN - JPM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Centrobanca SpA will launch a 500 billion lire eight-year FRN next week, sole bookrunner J.P. Morgan said on Friday. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
